OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'most haunted' pubs and hotels
OL,4,Awhere guests cannot explain encounters
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral pubs and hotels across the West
OL,7,FCountry have been rumoured to be
OL,8,Fhaunted by ghosts for centuries.
OL,10,FGuests staying in the historic venues
OL,11,Fclaim to experience strange noises and
OL,12,Fsounds, with one encounter even
OL,13,Fconvincing a TV presenter that there is
OL,14,F"definitely life after death".
OL,16,FAhead of Halloween, we have compiled
OL,17,Fsome of the most popular haunted
OL,18,Fstories from across the region.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
